  "title": "TestSREAgent [Please ignore]: Test Hotsite availability issue",
  "description": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Hotsite availability impacted. Run the below kusto query to get the impacted endpoints:</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">cluster('wawscus').database('wawsprod').All('AntaresIISLogFrontEndTable')</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">| where TIMESTAMP &gt; ago(1h)</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(80, 80, 80);\">| where S_sitename in ('hotsite4', 'hotsite2', 'hotsite3')</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">| where Sc_status &gt;= 500</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">| distinct S_sitename</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">For monitoring service health of the impacted endpoint, run the below query (e.g. for hotsite4):</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">cluster('wawscus').database('wawsprod').All('AntaresIISLogFrontEndTable')</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">| where TIMESTAMP &gt; ago(1h)</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">| where S_sitename == 'hotsite4'</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">| extend StatusResult = iff(Sc_status &gt;= 500, 0.0, 100.0)</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">| summarize Availability=avg(StatusResult) by bin(TIMESTAMP, 5m)</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"ordered\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">| order by TIMESTAMP asc</span></li></ol>",
